  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operationalisation of the Climate Resilience Execution Agency of Dominica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide support for the operation of the Climate Resilience Execution Agency of Dominica from 2019-2023 in order to implement Dominica&#x2019;s climate resilience and recovery plan. The Climate Resilience Execution Agency of Dominica is expected to support delivery of key recovery and reconstruction projects, build capacity and transform systems in the public sector so that Dominica is able build back better post Hurricane Maria and quickly recover from future disasters.</narrative>
  </description>
